      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BROKEN HALO (7) failed to come into contention last start after settling off pace at The Meadows, but prior to that won easily by 8 lengths at this track (30.78) beating Mepunga Velvet in a T3 RSTW on August 1. The form out of his last race has been franked. Has ability and is a key runner. ROCKY SUPERSTAR (5) is on a hot streak recording a 22.62 win over 400m at Geelong last start following on from a sharp 31.02 victory at this track over 545m the start prior. In form and looks a leading player again. SHE'S SALTY (1) hit the ground running to win over the 545m at this track two runs back then settled forward again when finishing third at Healesville last start. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Bold showing expected. KEEN ON KEV (2) profiles nicely over this trip.",
